Rich Interactivity for Complex Visualizations
For visual subjects like 3D structures, static images fall short. Quarto enables rich interactivity to help your audience explore the data and concepts.

3D Visualizations: Embed interactive 3D plots (e.g., using plotly, pyvista, vedo) to allow users to rotate, zoom. E.g. in Interactive Plot.
Diagrams: Natively create graph and state diagrams using embedded support for Mermaid and Graphviz—perfect for illustrating theoretical models or experimental setups.



